    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap Native RFC 3927 AutoIP (Link-Local 169.254.x.x) Engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Specifications:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RFC 3927 Dynamic Configuration of IPv4 Link-Local Addresses</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Address Range: 169.254.1.0 to 169.254.254.255</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Zero dynamic memory allocation (0 bytes heap) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
